# DNN Models

This directory provides the DNN models used in our paper.

The released model package includes:
- **Base DNN Models**: 24 representative DNN models used in the sampling process and described in the paper and appendix.
- **Model Variants**: DNN model variants generated through neural architecture search (NAS) and used in the evaluation experiments.

